=== 1kb, exact: `SMALL` declares 1024 bytes, image is 1024 bytes
editable

=== 1kb, one byte short: `SMALL` declares 1024 bytes, image is 1023 bytes
rom.bin@0x3FF: error[DEF0029]: the image is 1023 bytes but definition `SMALL` declares a file size of 1024 bytes (1 KiB) (1 bytes short), so it may not be this ROM or not all of it: opened read-only, editing is disabled
read-only: editing is disabled: the image is 1023 bytes, the definition declares 1024

